  "description": "Given a 2D integer array `matrix`, return the transpose of `matrix`. The transpose flips the matrix over its main diagonal, switching row and column indices.",
  "constraints": "1 <= R, C <= 100\n\u2022 Time: O(R*C) | Space: O(R*C)",
