  "solution": "def transpose_matrix(matrix: list[list[int]]) -> list[list[int]]:\n    if not matrix or not matrix[0]:\n        return []\n    return [list(col) for col in zip(*matrix)]\n",
  "explanation": "Zipping unpacked rows rotates indices (i, j) to (j, i) in O(R*C) time."
